OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GSunday:FMostly dry across central and  
OL,8,Fnorthern areas with sunny spells. Rain 
OL,9,Fspreads into the southwest with        
OL,10,Fstrengthening winds. Temperatures near 
OL,11,Fnormal, though rather cold for the     
OL,12,Fnorth and west.                        
OL,14,GOutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,15,Fstarts cloudy in the southwest as rain 
OL,16,Ffades. Brighter spells elsewhere.      
OL,17,FTuesday turns wetter and windier with  
OL,18,Frain moving east. Wednesday remains    
OL,19,Fmixed, with scattered rain and chilly  
OL,20,Fconditions.                            
