OL,4,CUK to explore even closer ties with EU 
OL,5,Cafter agreeing deal, says Burnham      
OL,6,GAndy Burnham said the UK will discuss  
OL,7,Gpossible options for even closer ties  
OL,8,Gwith the EU, after agreeing a deal     
OL,9,Gcovering British food exports,         
OL,10,Gemissions trading and a youth          
OL,11,Gexperience scheme.                     
OL,13,FThe prime minister said it was a "good 
OL,14,Fday" for Britain and Europe, adding    
OL,15,Fthe Treasury believes the deal could   
OL,16,Fboost the UK economy by up to #17bn a  
OL,17,Fyear.                                  
OL,19,FEuropean Council President Antonio     
OL,20,FCosta said the EU remains "open to     
OL,21,Fhave the closest possible              
OL,22,Frelationship" with the UK.             
OL,23,D]CParliament and politics digest...G144
