OL,4,CCalls for consent defence change after 
OL,5,CJoanne Young rape case                 
OL,6,GThe daughter of Joanne Young, who was  
OL,7,Gdrugged, raped and advertised for sex  
OL,8,Gonline by her husband, is among those  
OL,9,Gcalling for a change in the way cases  
OL,10,Gare defended in court.                 
OL,12,FPhilip Young drugged and abused his    
OL,13,Fwife over a 13-year period, using      
OL,14,Fwebsites and apps to invite men to     
OL,15,Ftheir home in Swindon without her      
OL,16,Fknowledge. On Thursday, four men were  
OL,17,Ffound guilty of sexual offences        
OL,18,Fagainst her.                           
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
