OL,4,CMan convicted of starting Palisades    
OL,5,Cfire in Los Angeles                    
OL,6,GA jury in Los Angeles has found a 30-  
OL,7,Gyear-old man guilty of starting one of 
OL,8,Gthe most destructive wildfires in      
OL,9,GCalifornia's history.                  
OL,11,FJonathan Rinderknecht was convicted of 
OL,12,Farson after starting the fires that    
OL,13,Fswept through Pacific Palisades and    
OL,14,Fparts of Malibu in January last year,  
OL,15,Fkilling 12 people and destroying more  
OL,16,Fthan 6,800 buildings in the US state.  
OL,18,FThe conviction was handed down nearly  
OL,19,Ffive months after deadlocked jurors    
OL,20,Fled to the judge declaring a mistrial. 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
