OL,4,CDaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months for 
OL,5,Cslashing dinghy                        
OL,6,GAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas    
OL,7,Ghas been jailed for 15 months for      
OL,8,Gslashing a dinghy with a knife in the  
OL,9,GEnglish Channel.                       
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his          
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, live-       
OL,13,Fstreamed himself cutting the boat      
OL,14,Fwhile a French rescue worker was on    
OL,15,Fboard in September.                    
OL,17,FSentencing him after he admitted       
OL,18,Fcriminal damage, a judge called Thomas 
OL,19,Fa "publicity seeker" whose actions     
OL,20,Fwere a "flagrant interference" with    
OL,21,Fthe work of rescue crews.              
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
