OL,4,CMan guilty of murdering woman he       
OL,5,Cgroomed on fetish site                 
OL,6,GA man has been found guilty of the     
OL,7,Gkidnap and murder of a woman who he    
OL,8,Ggroomed on a fetish website.           
OL,10,FDwain Hall, 54, convinced 32-year-old  
OL,11,FSonia Exelby from Southsea, Hampshire, 
OL,12,Fto travel to the United States where   
OL,13,Fhe stabbed her to death.               
OL,15,FOn Friday he was found guilty          
OL,16,Ffollowing a trial at a court in Ocala, 
OL,17,FFlorida, of kidnap and first-degree    
OL,18,Fmurder. He was then sentenced to life  
OL,19,Fin prison.                             
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
