OL,4,CRussian missile hits Poland as         
OL,5,CUkraine's allies hold military         
OL,6,Cexercise, says Tusk                    
OL,7,GPoland says a Russian cruise missile   
OL,8,Gwas among three objects that violated  
OL,9,Gits airspace early on Friday, with     
OL,10,GPrime Minister Donald Tusk saying it   
OL,11,Gdid not appear to be an accident when  
OL,12,GWestern military exercises were taking 
OL,13,Gplace in the region.                   
OL,15,FNobody was hurt and no damage has been 
OL,16,Freported, but Warsaw described the     
OL,17,Fincident as a "provocation" from       
OL,18,FMoscow.                                
